Package: gseamod
Title: Modular Gene Set Enrichment Analysis (Ackermann and Strimmer 2009)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("fossil contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@github.com")
Description: The modular framework for gene set enrichment analysis of Ackermann and
    Strimmer (2009, BMC Bioinformatics 10:47, <doi:10.1186/1471-2105-10-47>): a gene-level
    statistic (t, moderated t, correlation), a transformation (none, squared, rank of
    squared, binary, local FDR), a gene set statistic (mean, median, maxmean, enrichment
    score, Wilcoxon, conditional FDR) and a significance assessment (gene sampling,
    sample label permutation, restandardization, parametric), plus globaltest and
    Hotelling's T-squared with a shrinkage correlation matrix. Rebuilt from the paper's
    text; the authors' code is lost.
